      "source_xml_line": 1151,
      "string_id": "bar_bar_visitors_5_start_7111",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Nobody has managed to get through the vehicle scrapyard because of the Brain Scorcher. Some people did see a stalker go through the invisible border, fall over, then get up in a couple of minutes and head straight for the center of the scrapyards. He ain't been seen since...",
      "JA_current": "ブレイン・スコーチャーのせいで、車両墓場に入れた奴はいない。見えない境界を越えて倒れたストーカーが、数分後に起き上がり、そのまま車両墓場の中心へ向かったのを見た奴がいる。でも、それきり戻ってこない……",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_bar_visitors_5_start",
          "phrase_id": "7111",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
